{0E}*      Authorized personnel only beyond this point      *
*              Joker Land Administration Office               *
*                       Office hours: from 7 PM                       *{0F}{w}

A single troll stands there
like an ornament.{w}The troll stares at you in silence.{w}{p}Its huge body fills the whole passage;
there's no way to slip past it.{w}{p}The troll looks away from you
and slowly raises its club.{w}

"Precisely.{w}We cut notches into every desk and chair,
rigged so they split in two -- unnaturally cleanly."{w}{p}"In this way, we produce a show that is safe and yet full of thrills."{w}{p}"And all the bloodshed will be fake.{w}We place capsules of stage blood all over,
so that as they play, they get bloodier and bloodier..."{w}

{0E}*                                          *
*              Rest in peace.              *
*                                          *{0F}{w}

A knight of fearsome appearance stood before you.{w}You could not make out the knight's face well,
but its bearing suggested no trace of reason.{w}{p}You had shown no particular hostility,
yet it seemed you were fated to fight.{w}

"C'mon, it's not that great.
That weird thing's brought us nothin' but grief.
Let's just ditch it already, right around here's fine..."{w}

"Yeah, right!
We got tossed inside it, the terrain changed every single time,
it put us through hell, y'know!? Toss it, toss it!"{w}

"Once we took it out of that place, it stopped doing anything, right?
If we just figure out how to use it, it'll be A-OK...
Ah, I said don't throw it away!"{w}

"And who's gonna figure that out?
If we can't toss it, then we hand it off to somebody... Oh?
Perfect timing. Hey, you folks want this?"{w}

"We picked it up in the Crotoa City Ruins, and
get this! It's a Strange Box Garden -- you can go inside it
and have all kinds of adventures! Whaddaya say?"{w}

"But if you're goin' in, watch yourselves.
It's a real handful in there.
See ya!"{w}

"If you put that box garden back where it was
in the Crotoa City Ruins, you can get inside.
As for the spot... ...Sorry, I forgot."{w}

{0E}
                    Desert Wind
{0F}{w}

Deep in the desert,
there was a monster of grotesque form.{w}{p}Why did it look this way?{w}Why had it been locked up?{w}Why was it here?{w}{p}All of it was shrouded in mystery.{w}But judging by that raised fist,{w}{p}he (or she),
as far as you were concerned, at least,{w}was hardly a presence to be welcomed, it is safe to say.{w}

"No good, no good, no no no good!
That's nowhere near enough!"{w}{p}"Don't you dare take
Professor Rombino lightly!"{w}

As you were about to leave,
Professor Rombino was munching away right in front of you.{w}{p}Something stick-shaped
was poking out of the professor's mouth.{w}

"Oh, are you maybe not part of this?{w}...Well, see, we're using our abandoned school building
for a test of courage to welcome the new students."{w}{p}"It's at the old mansion in the Perpeco Forest,
and we hold it at night."{w}{p}"I mean, nobody can handle spirits, right?
So it's training to not be scared of ghosts!{w}...That's our excuse for throwing the welcome party, anyway."{w}

"Since you're here, you should totally go!{w}All you do is put a mark on the Alchemy Department's blackboard
and come back!"{w}{p}"And of course,
noth-ing-is-gon-na-hap-pen.{w}Mm-hm, mm-hm!"{w}

"Fu fu fu~
That's nowhere near enough!"{w}{p}"Don't you dare take
Professor Nambino lightly!"{w}

As you were about to leave,
Professor Nambino was munching away right in front of you.{w}{p}Something stick-shaped
was poking out of the professor's mouth.{w}

"They say we're doing a test of courage
at the freshman welcome party.
I'm no good with scary stuff~..."{w}

{0E}"I sense a power hidden within you all!
Yes, you have what it takes to become heroes!{0F}
The makings of heroes who will save this world!"{w}{p}"But that power has not yet awakened!{w}I shall guide you!{w}Down the road that leads to heroism!"{w}

{0E}"To think you would endure every last one of my trials...
From this day forth, you may call yourselves heroes!!{0F}
Nothing could make me happier!!"{w}

"In that case,
I shall pump them full of vigor
so they take on a form worthy of you!"{w}

{0E}"Here I go!
Nnnnnghhhhhhh...{0F}
Bwahahahahaha!!"{w}

"The road you have walked so far
will become new strength
and support you in body and soul!"{w}

"I just don't understand how young people think these days.{w}I give them tougher assignments
thinking it'll help them grow, and they run off."{w}{p}"So then I give them easy stuff instead,
and they just keep getting worse and worse...{w}Hrrrmm..."{w}

"I may have said that, but
being a school teacher is hard...
No tiiiime~......"{w}

A short way off, a mage was muttering
words you couldn't make out.{w}A teacher, perhaps?{w}{p}Soon the mage noticed you, broke into a slimy grin,
hitched up the robe, and came charging straight at you.{w}

"...So, thing is, we've got ourselves a problem.{w}Ogre Bay's had these special cannon blueprints
handed down since way back."{w}{p}"I got 'em from my old man too, but...{w}see, the... blueprints, I kinda... went an' lost 'em...
At this rate, we can't build it!!"{w}

"'Course I did!
We're shootin' down the Palace of the Sun, y'know?
You'd be missin' out if you didn't come watch!"{w}

"...Right. Hey, you lot.
Pop on over to the Palace of the Sun for a bit!!"{w}{p}"Look, we've got this mighty fine cannon right here.
I'll fire you up there with it!"{w}{p}"Aw, no need to worry. It'll work out somehow.{w}...Off you go!!"{w}

"Don't worry, this plan's bound to work!
Worryin' is a total waste of time, y'know?
Relax and off you go!!"{w}

"So, how's it feel inside the cannon?
Surprisingly cozy, huh?"{w}{p}"Hey, next time you open your eyes, you'll be right at the Palace of the Sun!
Give it your best!!"{w}{p}"Okay, startin' the countdown."{w}

"You did splendidly, despite such a reckless plan.
Now we can rest easy, at least for the time being.
Thank you very much."{w}

"Oh, right.
More importantly, go take a look outside!
Everybody's waitin' for you."{w}{p}"Oi, you lot!!{w}Fire yourselves up! The parade's startin'!!!"{w}

"You lot did good.
See? You made it back just fine, didn't ya!!"{w}{p}"I owe you lot one.
Next time, the drinks are on me!"{w}
